## 🔥 What is AEGIS?

**AEGIS** is an elite, production-grade sovereign AI infrastructure platform. Engineered for zero-downtime autonomy, multi-server fleet management, web intelligence, and self-healing systems. Powered by the Claude Agent SDK and Hermes Agent architecture, AEGIS bridges cognitive LLM reasoning with deterministic OS execution.

---

## ⚡ Live Telemetry & Architecture Mesh

```ascii
      +-------------------------------------------------------+
      |               AEGIS MULTI-INTERFACE MESH              |
      |   [ CLI / REPL ]  [ TUI Dashboard ]  [ Telegram Bot ] |
      +---------------------------+---------------------------+
                                  |
                                  v
      +-------------------------------------------------------+
      |                  AEGIS NEURAL CORE (aegisd)           |
      |   +------------------+  +-------------------------+   |
      |   |   Effort Router  |  |     AST Safety Engine   |   |
      |   |  (Trivial -> Max)|  |   (READ -> HIGH Risk)   |   |
      |   +------------------+  +-------------------------+   |
      +---------------------------+---------------------------+
                                  |
                                  v
      +-------------------------------------------------------+
      |                 DETERMINISTIC EXECUTORS               |
      |   [ Shell / SSH ] [ Docker ] [ Obscura Web ] [ Fleet ]|
      +-------------------------------------------------------+
```

