## 🌟 Elite Features Matrix

| Feature | Description | Status |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **🧠 Neural Effort Router** | Dynamic thinking budget allocation (`trivial` to `max` reasoning) | 🟢 Active |
| **🛡️ 4-Tier AST Classifier** | Real-time command risk assessment (`READ`, `LOW`, `MEDIUM`, `HIGH`) | 🟢 Active |
| **🌐 Obscura Web Engine** | Headless browser extraction & DOM intelligence | 🟢 Active |
| **👥 Sovereign Fleet Grid** | Distributed server orchestration & rolling canary deployments | 🟢 Active |
| **🧬 Self-Healing Evolution** | Nightly telemetry analysis & automated skill optimization | 🟢 Active |
| **💬 Telegram Gateway** | Inline approval buttons, mobile commands & push alerts | 🟢 Active |
| **💾 SQLite WAL + FTS5** | Immutable audit logs, fast fact-store & episodic memory search | 🟢 Active |

